/*
=========================================================
MASTER FINAL V2
=========================================================

MASTER NANO RESPONSIBILITIES
----------------------------
- HC06 Bluetooth Communication
- LCD Display
- Buzzer Startup Tune
- Dispenser Sensor
- Dispenser Servo
- Box Sensor
- Yellow Button
- Pink Button
- Score System
- I2C Master Communication
- GUI Messaging

I2C COMMANDS
------------
1 = START_LIFT
2 = CLEAR_RESULT

SLAVE RETURNS
-------------
0  = NONE
12 = YELLOW
13 = PINK

BLUETOOTH COMMANDS
------------------
START
STOP
DISPENSE
SYS:MODE:AUTO
SYS:MODE:MANUAL

GUI MESSAGES
------------
STATUS:READY
STATUS:RUNNING
STATUS:IDLE

BALL:YELLOW
BALL:PINK

GAME:CORRECT
GAME:WRONG

SCORE:x

DISP:LOCKED
